The thread started in reference to the stated conflict between the BPFK 
and the Lojban Coders Group. It is not apparent from public sources who 
controls the Lojban Coders Group account on github, which is of course 
key information to understand the dynamics of this apparent conflict 
affecting core Lojban assets. Hence the question.

This is a very specific question, with a specific answer. Yet you have 
posted three times in this thread already without providing any useful 
information, which makes for a rather awful signal-to-noise ratio. Do 
you know the answer or not?

